  {
    "sha": "7c431ef66f08f88acede3c43d1f5c285a1ad216e",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVoU8JdoAKDdjNDMxZWY2NmYwOGY4OGFjZWRlM2M0M2QxZjVjMjg1YTFhZDIxNmU",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-18T11:57:22Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-18T11:57:22Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge main into issue/2201-highlighter-frame-perf (input-keyed caches only)\n\nHand-resolved: model features_of (main's Weak memo), resolve_chain call\nsites (main's model::resolve_chain; feature/index.rs dropped),\nworld::collect (main's frame_memo::scene_scope; the vertex cache kept and\nkeyed by facet allocation and pose), pick_ink::paint (batched meshes plus\nmain's start and exit marks), shell.rs row hover (inside main's\nframe_cost timer).\n\nDropped the caches keyed by a document counter: scene, regions, toolpath\nlines, the six panel caches and commands::revision_token. HighlightCache\nis re-keyed to its inputs, like pick_line_memo. New pins: the counter and\nchanged-input tests in pick_highlight_tests.rs and frame_cache_tests.rs.\n\nRefs #2201\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
