      "message": "test(ui): pin the pick-highlight screen-mesh cache with build counters\n\nEach screen-mesh slot (selected, viewport hover, row hover) is now a\nMeshSlot with its own build counter. New tests in\npick_highlight_mesh_tests.rs: a still frame tessellates once in each\nslot; an orbit, a pane resize and an ink change each tessellate again\nand the painted vertices move or change colour. The outline cache\ncounts the viewport hover and the row hover apart, and the viewport\nhover gets its own pin.\n\nReview non-blockers: a cache hit sends a clone of the Arc<Mesh>, not a\ndeep copy; toolpath_warning_count (no caller) is removed and\ntoolpath_nonempty moves to model/toolpath.rs; pick_ink.rs keeps main's\nCRLF line ends and its doc names the real row-hover path; the decision\nfile names the mesh cache pins.\n\nRefs #2201\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
